namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::SpriteLayer::portToLayerOffset

\brief adjust the offset to account for the effective camera

Since an offset is relative rather than fixed in coordinate space, this means only rotating it around 0,0 to match the effective camera rotation, and changing the offset length by the camera zoom. The camera translation is not factored in.

\param o Offset in port coordinates

\returns Offset in layer coordinates

**/ }